.SH "NAME"
Encode::ISO2022::CCS \- coded character sets for ISO/IEC 2022 character encoding scheme
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
This document lists encodings which may be used as coded character set
(\s-1CCS\s0) for \s-1ISO/IEC 2022\s0 character encoding scheme.
.PP
From view of Perl, a \s-1CCS\s0 is the Encode::Encoding object performing
stateless and fixed-length conversion over 94^n or 96^n code table
(By now, Encode::ISO2022 does not support variable length multibyte \s-1CCS\s0).
.PP
In tables below,
\&\*(L"reg#\*(R" column indicates the number of registry in
\&\s-1ISO\s0 International Registry of Coded Character Sets [\s-1ISO\-IR\s0].
.SS "Built-in encodings"
.IX Subsection "Built-in encodings"
.Vb 6
\&  reg# Name                  Description
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
\&    6  ascii                 ANSI X3.4\-1986, equivalent to ISO 646 IRV
\&   \-   ascii\-ctrl            ISO 6429 control characters (C0)
\&   \-   c1\-ctrl               ISO 6429 control characters (C1)
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
.Ve
.SS "Encode::ISOIRSingle"
.IX Subsection "Encode::ISOIRSingle"
