\fIEncode::JP\fR
.IX Subsection "Encode::JP"
.PP
.Vb 6
\&  reg# Name                  Description
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
\&   87  jis0208\-raw           JIS X 0208\-1983, 2nd rev. of JIS X 0208
\&  168      ditto             JIS X 0208\-1990, 3rd rev. of JIS X 0208
\&  159  jis0212\-raw           JIS X 0212\-1990
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
.Ve
.IP "\(bu" 4
About compatible encodings taking care of characters with combining marks,
see Encode::JISX0213::CCS.
.IP "\(bu" 4
Note that \s-1GL\s0 mapping of \f(CW\*(C`jis0201\-raw\*(C'\fR provided by this module is broken.
Use \f(CW\*(C`iso\-646\-jp\*(C'\fR provided by Encode::ISOIRSingle.
.PP
